{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19881","headline":"饥雪吟 · 孟郊","name":"饥雪吟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"饥乌夜相啄，疮声互悲鸣。\n冰肠一直刀，天杀无曲情。\n大雪压梧桐，折柴堕峥嵘。\n安知鸾凤巢，不与枭鸢倾。\n下有幸灾儿，拾遗多新争。\n但求彼失所，但夸此经营。\n君子亦拾遗，拾遗非拾名。\n将补鸾凤巢，免与枭鸢幷。\n因爲饥雪吟，至晓竟不平。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19881.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19881","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}